WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
The house is so cold.
The heat pump has stopped.

2
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:12.560
Hello, I'm Lucas. I repair heat pumps.
Let me look at the outdoor unit.

3
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.820
Can you fix it today?

4
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:20.120
I'll check the filters and the
pressure, then I restart the system.

5
00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.000
You'll have heating again.
